-- Simple VDM-RT template
-- VDM-RT extends VDM++ with real-time and concurrency concepts.
-- This template is intentionally simple: a single class with one operation.
-- Over time you can add system blocks, CPUs, buses and threads here.

class SimpleClass

operations

    -- Operations in VDM-RT can read and write state and model timing.
    -- This operation is pure (no side effects), but defined as an operation
    -- so it can be called from the interpreter with 'new SimpleClass().Add(...)'.

    public Add: nat * nat ==> nat
    Add(a, b) ==
        return a + b;

end SimpleClass